  "decision_conditions": [
    "By virtue of its combined bulk, depth, height, and siting, the proposed detached dwellinghouse would result in an unneighbourly, overbearing and visually intrusive form of development, which fails to safeguard the residential amenities of the occupiers of nos. 79 and 103 Wensleydale Road. As such, the proposal is not considered to accord with Policy LP 8 of the Local Plan (2018) and emerging Policy 46 of the Publication Local Plan (Regulation 19)."
